<title>ITALY: Credito Italiano '96 net profit up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Credito Italiano '96 net profit up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated, provisional)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   250   (up 30 pct)</p>
<p>    Gross operating profit 1,080   (up 20 pct)</p>
<p>    Total loans	     72,000   (up 8.0 pct)</p>
<p>    Total deposits	 200,000   vs   n/a</p>
<p>    Doubtful debts	   1,182   vs  1,214</p>
<p>Note - Credito Italiano said finalk results for 196 would be approved by the board on February 27.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129450</p>
</text>
